 "lrc": "[00:00.00]I asked you to be my lady\n[00:22.24]You first said, \"Maybe\"\n[00:24.16]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[00:26.64]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[00:29.12]I asked you to be my lady\n[00:31.92]You kept drivin' me crazy\n[00:34.24]Now every time my phone lights up\n[00:37.20]Girl, it's always \"Baby\"\n[00:39.76]Back then I was all in, you played it cool\n[00:42.48]Slow replies like I had somethin' to prove\n[00:44.72]Now the vibe done switched, ain't that funny\n[00:47.76]Same smile, different energy\n[00:50.16]You see me outside, livin' life lately\n[00:52.48]Now you wonder why I'm movin' so wavy\n[00:55.04]No hard feelings, no bad blood\n[00:57.52]Guess we both just grew, that's what's up\n[00:59.76]I asked you to be my lady\n[01:02.24]You first said, \"Maybe\"\n[01:04.08]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[01:06.56]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[01:09.68]Now it's \"Where you at?\"\n[01:11.28]Now it's \"Can we talk?\"\n[01:12.56]Now it's \"Come through\" every other call\n[01:15.04]Funny what a little confidence do\n[01:17.44]Funny what a little— hold up, that's you?\n[01:19.92]Forty-seven missed, and it's quarter past two\n[01:22.48]Car outside runnin', how you know my new—\n[01:24.72]Used to chase you\n[01:25.92]Now you chase me\n[01:27.28]For real\n[01:27.92]Somebody come and saaaave me\n[01:29.84]You know my mama's number, you ain't never met my mama\n[01:32.40]You know the door code, and I changed the door code\n[01:34.72]Left a plate in my kitchen, went and folded up my laundry\n[01:37.20]That ain't sweet, that's a warning, that's a warning\n[01:40.00]\"Maybe\" was the right answer then\n[01:44.88]'Cause if you'd said no\n[01:48.00]We wouldn't be here now\n[01:50.00]Funny how the timing changed\n[01:53.20]Now you know my name\n[01:55.68]You know my name\n[01:56.80]Now you know my name\n[01:58.08]You know my name\n[01:58.08]You know too much of my name\n[01:59.52]I asked you to be my lady\n[02:01.20](Pick up, pick up, pick up)\n[02:02.64]You first said, \"Maybe\"\n[02:03.76](Please, pick up)\n[02:04.16]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[02:06.56]Now you can't stop callin' me baby\n[02:08.64]Funny how life changes\n[02:11.84]Funny how love changes\n[02:14.00]Yesterday was \"Maybe\"\n[02:16.72]Today it's \"Baby\"\n[02:19.20]Tomorrow I ain't answerin' —\n"
}